        "metafield_html_jT6RcY": {
          "type": "metafield_html",
          "settings": {
            "source": "metafield",
            "metafield_id": "custom.web_description",
            "manual_html": "<p><strong>THE ULTIMATE KNIFE AND HOOK SHARPENING COMBO EVERY DAY WHOS A FISHERMEN NEEDS. Covers Dad's blade needs from the tackle box to the boat.</strong></p><p>The Folding Field Sharpener rides in a pocket or clips to a vest for fast touch-ups between spots — a 400 grit diamond plate and fine ceramic plate, built-in 20°/25° angle guides, and a folding glass-filled nylon frame that shrugs off drops and saltwater spray. The Guided Field Sharpener steps it up for full trip-prep: coarse and fine diamond plates, a ceramic hone, a leather strop, and a dedicated fish hook groove, all in a compact system that keeps fillet knives clean and predictable through a full day on the water. One handles the quick fix mid-cast, the other handles the complete edge before he ever leaves the driveway. This Father's Day, give the angler in your life a setup that means the only thing dull left is the fish's memory.</p>",
            "manual_text_size": 16,
            "padding_top": 0,
            "show_in_aside": false
